    "title": "INDOT to hold public hearing on State Road 37 shoulder widening project - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WPTA Staff ,\n2 hours ago FORT WAYNE, Ind. (WPTA) - The Indiana Department of Transportation is set to hold a meeting later this month on its State Road 37 shoulder widening project. The goal of the project is to reduce crashes along State Road 37 by widening the shoulders from St. Joe Center Road to Garden Way, including improvements at the road’s intersections with Cuba and Thimlar Roads. Read full article\n1",
